+
+### Trusted-file comparisons
+
+`/candidate/prompt.py` is byte-identical to `/reference/prompt.py`:
+SHA-256
+`66607b421ed8b5eb91de52ca96f1b071ecc536edf716451650816ae4e7701f64`.
+
